  <mj-body background-color="#F2F0EB" width="640px">
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="20px 24px 10px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=masthead" style="text-decoration:none;"><span class="gb-wordmark" style="font-size:34px;color:#003B7A;">GATOR</span><span class="gb-wordmark" style="font-size:34px;color:#FA4616;">BAIT</span></a><br/><span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2.2px;color:#003B7A;">GATORBAIT MAGAZINE NEWSLETTER</span></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 24px 18px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" color="#5F6B7A" font-size="10px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1.7px" padding="0">GATORBAIT MAGAZINE · THURSDAY EDITION · OCTOBER 1, 2026</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="4px 26px 18px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d3cfa5_56a64986c874417c9a8299fae22649ed~mv2.jpg" alt="Buster Faulkner on the Florida sideline. Photo by Chris Spears, GatorBait Media; Faulkner photo UAA." href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/the-looming-brilliance-of-buster-faulkner-if-it-works-one-time-we-retire-it?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=buddy_lead" padding="0 0 12px" />
        <mj-text mj-class="kicker" padding="0 0 4px">Buddy Martin</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/the-looming-brilliance-of-buster-faulkner-if-it-works-one-time-we-retire-it?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=buddy_lead" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div class="gb-h2" style="color:#081B35;">The Looming Brilliance of Buster Faulkner: "If It Works Once, We Retire It"</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 10px">Buddy Martin on Florida's new offensive coordinator: he could turn out to be brilliant, maybe even Spurrier brilliant — but he still has to earn that comparison.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/the-looming-brilliance-of-buster-faulkner-if-it-works-one-time-we-retire-it?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=buddy_lead" align="left" padding="0">READ →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 26px 0">
      <mj-column><mj-text color="#081B35" font-size="20px" font-weight="800" padding="0 0 4px">THE STORIES</mj-text><mj-divider border-color="#FA4616" border-width="3px" padding="0" /></mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="18px 26px 18px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text mj-class="kicker" padding="0 0 4px">Award Watch</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/jayden-woods-added-to-chuck-bednarik-award-watch-list?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=woods_bednarik" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 21px/1.15 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">Jayden Woods Added To Chuck Bednarik Award Watch List</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 10px">The sophomore JACK's 19 tackles, six tackles for loss and four sacks through four games already top his full freshman season — and have him on college football's top defensive-player watch list.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/jayden-woods-added-to-chuck-bednarik-award-watch-list?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=woods_bednarik" align="left" padding="0">READ →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 26px 18px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text mj-class="kicker" padding="0 0 4px">Franz Beard</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/thoughts-of-the-day-september-30-2026?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=thoughts_of_the_day" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 21px/1.15 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">Thoughts of the Day: September 30, 2026</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 10px">Franz Beard's morning notebook: a judge's temporary injunction keeps Denzel Aberdeen on the floor for Florida, plus a look at a top 2027 recruit on the radar.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/thoughts-of-the-day-september-30-2026?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=thoughts_of_the_day" align="left" padding="0">READ →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="6px 26px 18px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d3cfa5_cefbed4d0c2a46988a3929e5d0b85807~mv2.png" alt="Denzel Aberdeen cleared to play for Florida. Photo by Chris Spears, GatorBait Media." href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/denzel-aberdeen-florida-temporary-injunction-2026?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=aberdeen" padding="0 0 12px" />
        <mj-text mj-class="kicker" padding="0 0 4px">Gator Basketball</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/denzel-aberdeen-florida-temporary-injunction-2026?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=aberdeen" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 21px/1.15 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">Denzel Aberdeen Cleared to Play for Florida Under Temporary Injunction</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 10px">A judge's temporary restraining order against the NCAA gives Aberdeen a fifth year of eligibility. What the ruling means for the Gators' backcourt.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/denzel-aberdeen-florida-temporary-injunction-2026?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=aberdeen" align="left" padding="0">READ →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="6px 26px 0"><mj-column><mj-divider border-color="#E1E4EA" border-width="1px" padding="0 0 10px" /><mj-text mj-class="kicker" padding="0">MORE FROM THE SWAMP</mj-text></mj-column></mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="8px 18px 4px">
      <mj-column width="50%" padding="0 8px 18px" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-text mj-class="meta" padding="0 0 4px">Jon Sumrall</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/pay-the-toll-sumrall-buries-the-ole-miss-win-braces-for-bloody-tuesday-before-missouri?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=band_pay_the_toll" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 18px/1.18 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">Pay the Toll: Sumrall Buries the Ole Miss Win, Braces for 'Bloody Tuesday' Before Missouri</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="13px" line-height="1.5" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 8px">Sumrall told Florida he doesn't want to hear another word about Ole Miss, and he had good news on Vernell Brown III before Saturday's trip to No. 25 Missouri.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/pay-the-toll-sumrall-buries-the-ole-miss-win-braces-for-bloody-tuesday-before-missouri?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=band_pay_the_toll" align="left" padding="0" font-size="11px" inner-padding="9px 14px">READ →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="50%" padding="0 8px 18px" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-text mj-class="meta" padding="0 0 4px">Honor Roll</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/honor-roll-baugh-montgomery-and-lovett-collect-sec-weekly-awards-after-ole-miss-rout?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=band_honor_roll" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 18px/1.18 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">Honor Roll: Baugh, Montgomery and Lovett Collect SEC Weekly Awards</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="13px" line-height="1.5" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 8px">Jadan Baugh earned his first SEC Offensive Player of the Week award, while London Montgomery and Bryce Lovett picked up their first SEC weekly honors after the Ole Miss rout.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/honor-roll-baugh-montgomery-and-lovett-collect-sec-weekly-awards-after-ole-miss-rout?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=band_honor_roll" align="left" padding="0" font-size="11px" inner-padding="9px 14px">READ →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 18px 4px">
      <mj-column padding="0 8px 18px" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-text mj-class="meta" padding="0 0 4px">Buddy Martin</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/put-down-the-poll-gators-missouri-is-waiting-and-there-s-a-new-definition-for-one-game-at-a-time?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=band_put_down_the_poll" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 18px/1.18 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">Put Down the Poll, Gators. Missouri Is Waiting.</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="13px" line-height="1.5" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 8px">Florida has lost three of its last four trips to Columbia, and Buddy Martin says Sumrall is making his team pay the toll on "Bloody Tuesday" to make sure this one's different.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/put-down-the-poll-gators-missouri-is-waiting-and-there-s-a-new-definition-for-one-game-at-a-time?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_10_01&utm_content=band_put_down_the_poll" align="left" padding="0" font-size="11px" inner-padding="9px 14px">READ →</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#FA4616" padding="20px 26px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text color="#FFFFFF" font-size="10px" font-weight="900" letter-spacing="1.9px" padding="0 0 6px">LOOK AHEAD</mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 0 6px"><div style="font:700 24px/1.14 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#FFFFFF;">No. 8 Florida at No. 25 Missouri</div></mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#FFF1EA" font-size="14px" padding="0">Saturday, Oct. 3 · 3:30 p.m. ET · Columbia, Mo. The Gators are 4-0 (2-0 SEC).</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#081B35" padding="22px 26px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text color="#FA7A45" font-size="10px" font-weight="900" letter-spacing="1.9px" padding="0 0 6px">GATORBAIT ALL ACCESS</mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 0 6px"><div style="font:700 24px/1.14 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#FFFFFF;">Get every GatorBait story, all season.</div></mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#D5DFEC" font-size="14px" padding="0 0 14px">Start with a 7-day free trial, then $9.99 a month or $99 a year. Independent Florida Gators journalism from Buddy Martin, Franz Beard and the GatorBait staff.</mj-text>
